["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Iron Age Ireland sacral kingship Fianna currach opidum\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-ancients-爱尔兰铁器时代没有凯尔特人入侵-只有贸易和语言/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ef50c48b77dede87-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>愛爾蘭鐵器時代沒有凱爾特人入侵，只有貿易和語言</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">傳統說法認為凱爾特人帶著鐵器在公元前500年入侵愛爾蘭，但考古幾乎找不到外來移民的痕跡——凱爾特身份其實是青銅時代晚期海上貿易網絡裡慢慢長出來的語言共同體。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">考古</span><span class=\"tag\">愛爾蘭</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Battle of Stamford Bridge Explained berserk chape house carls Varangian Guard Doomsday Book\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-historyhit-斯坦福桥大捷被黑斯廷斯一笔勾销-考古刚找到战场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cc50d2d1c5ba1e0e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">31:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>斯坦福橋大捷被黑斯廷斯一筆勾銷，考古剛找到戰場</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1066年9月，英王哈羅德四天急行軍約200英里，全殲哈拉爾德·哈德拉達的維京大軍；但這場足以奠定任何君主聲望的勝利，幾天後就被黑斯廷斯的慘敗徹底抹去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>13</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">維京時代</span><span class=\"tag\">1066年</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"394. Road To 9/11: Hijackers, CIA Failures, and America’s Darkest Day (Part 6) cock-up view of history muscle hijackers casing videotape the wall ghazia\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-empirehist-cia-提前数月警告-白宫为何还是没拦住-9-11/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1805b3753086ecbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">46:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>CIA 提前數月警告，白宮為何還是沒攔住 9/11</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">情報系統把戰略預警做到了極致，但決策者可以選擇無視——這是 9/11 前七個月真正的失敗點。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">情報失靈</span><span class=\"tag\">組織決策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"704. Roman Civil War: Master of the Republic (Part 4) proscription lictor tribunate adulescentulus carnifex Campus Martius\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-restishistory-苏拉用血洗罗马-却亲手为凯撒铺好了路/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>蘇拉用血洗羅馬，卻親手為凱撒鋪好了路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蘇拉是第一個帶兵打進羅馬的人，他贏了內戰、當上獨裁官、又主動退位。但他打破的禁忌再也收不回來——凱撒說他是傻瓜，因為他交出了獨裁權。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">羅馬史</span><span class=\"tag\">內戰</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"At The Money: Considering a Career Change? How About FINFLUENCER? finfluencer RIA Roth IRA cringe phase top of funnel W-2\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-mastersinbiz-做金融网红不是当网红-是把社媒当漏斗顶端/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7fb210b1031bb956-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">30:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>做金融網紅不是當網紅，是把社媒當漏斗頂端</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tyler Gardner 從教師轉行做理財顧問，再轉做金融內容，做到 600 萬粉絲。他的判斷是：短視頻只是漏斗頂端，真正的資產是你能自己擁有的郵件列表和長內容。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">個人品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">金融內容</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"5 Solo Founders Called In With Their Hardest Problem | Solo Founders Office Hours RL environment jobs to be done GMV ERP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-solofounders-单人创始人最缺的不是人手-是有人逼你说真话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9f64dfbc7c597bfb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">47:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">單人創始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>單人創始人最缺的不是人手，是有人逼你說真話</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Julian 給五位單人創始人的診斷幾乎都指向同一件事：沒有聯合創始人，你就失去了那個逼你面對「今天到底做了什麼」的人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">單人創業</span><span class=\"tag\">早期融資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"11 Marketing Rules every Creator needs to know: Kate Tolo bouncer ticket price yes and\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-colinsamir-把内容当夜店-算法是保安-你唯一的工作是让他放你进去/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac1190aacdd40897-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Colin and Samir</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>把內容當夜店：算法是保安，你唯一的工作是讓他放你進去</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Kate Tolo 用五年把 Brian Johnson 從 2000 粉做到千萬粉，她的核心比喻是：算法是夜店保安，只在乎場內的人玩得開不開心，你失敗一百次也沒人看見。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">內容策略</span><span class=\"tag\">增長</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Can AI help us better predict the weather? numerical weather prediction GraphCast GenCast functional generative networks spaghetti plots load forecasting\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-deepmind-ai-预报飓风提前一周锁定五级-靠的是统计不是物理/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.simplecastcdn.com/images/69d76c2c-4017-4f2f-8838-a33d03d55657/ba57c63a-db75-4c9c-a506-a4bba82c41d1/3000x3000/cropped_1788889769029.jpg?aid=rss_feed\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">44:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Google DeepMind</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>AI 預報颶風提前一週鎖定五級，靠的是統計不是物理</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">傳統數值預報靠解流體方程，AI 靠從歷史天氣裡學統計規律。颶風 Melissa 在還是熱帶低壓時就被模型以約 80% 置信度鎖定為五級，比傳統模型更早更狠。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 天氣預測</span><span class=\"tag\">DeepMind</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Ashurbanipal cuneiform colophon Neo-Assyrian Sardanapalus Bisitun inscription\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-stuffmissed-亚述巴尼拔的图书馆-他既是暴君-也是最早的藏书家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">37:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>亞述巴尼拔的圖書館：他既是暴君，也是最早的藏書家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">亞述巴尼拔一邊把敵國國王關進狗窩、逼人用祖先骨頭做磚，一邊建起人類最早的系統性圖書館，讓《吉爾伽美什史詩》活到今天。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">歷史</span><span class=\"tag\">考古</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Jared Diamond on Leaders, Luck, and Irreplaceability environmental Kuznets curve natural experiments Dvorak keyboard\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-tyler-没有不可替代的领袖-只有不可替代的运气/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2d90e9a992692a3e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">52:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>沒有不可替代的領袖，只有不可替代的運氣</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">戴蒙德研究領袖五十年，結論是長期看沒有哪個領袖不可替代——成吉思汗只是恰好生在兩千年來最溼潤的草原上，換個人也許一樣。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">領導力</span><span class=\"tag\">歷史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"When will average people feel AI’s impact? Engels’ pause Navier-Stokes Millennium Prize Problem\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-interconnects-ai-对普通人是舍入误差-扩散要五十年-反弹却等不了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2ea9ccfe0923b7a0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">8:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>AI 對普通人是舍入誤差：擴散要五十年，反彈卻等不了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">工業革命給普通人便宜衣服和縫紉機，AI 目前只給普通人好玩的圖片和更好的搜索——好處太間接，而政治反彈來得太快。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 擴散</span><span class=\"tag\">公眾認知</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Who Grades the AI Models? | Ben Horowitz &amp; Rayan Krishnan held-out private benchmarks recursive self-improvement (RSI) reward hacking token maxing harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-a16z-公开榜单测不出模型真实能力-第三方评测才是刚需/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">39:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>公開榜單測不出模型真實能力，第三方評測才是剛需</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Llama 4 在公開榜單上表現驚人，在 Vals 的私有留出集上卻是不達標——自報成績和真實能力之間的裂縫，正在催生一個獨立的評測行業。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI評測</span><span class=\"tag\">基準測試</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Meteorology (WEATHER &amp; CLIMATE) Encore with Marshall Shepherd Clausius-Clapeyron equation wet bulb globe temperature bombogenesis atmospheric river ENSO AMO\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-ologies-天气预报准确率-95-但没人相信它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>天氣預報準確率 95%，但沒人相信它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">氣象學家說預報三到五天內有 95% 準確率，公眾只記住被淋溼的那一次；氣候不是未來時，是現在進行時。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">氣象</span><span class=\"tag\">氣候傳播</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How we built Grok Bot in a month | Roman Ugarte (SpaceXAI) MCP steering infovore unshipping\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-lennys-grok-bot-一个月做出来-小团队躲进山洞-大团队会拖没微决策/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/42cbfb013ec2988d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>Grok Bot 一個月做出來：小團隊躲進山洞，大團隊會拖沒微決策</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把知識工作做進 Cursor 不是顯然錯誤，但用戶能聞出三套願景共用一塊屏——那是把組織架構圖直接發貨。所以 Grok Bot 從零開始，幾個人躲進山洞一個月。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>17</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">產品設計</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Sarah Longwell on How Democrats Can Defeat Trump focus group low-information voters Build Baby, Build\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-goodfight-特朗普的不可复制性-才是民主党真正的机会/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>特朗普的不可複製性，才是民主黨真正的機會</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">特朗普的持久力來自幾十年電視名人身份，別人學不來；民主黨若把特朗普時代的教訓當成通用規律，就會在2028年重蹈2024年的覆轍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美國政治</span><span class=\"tag\">選舉策略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"OpenAI Researchers on the Future of Mathematical Reasoning sphere packing linear programming bound spherical code sofic group Aldous–Lyons conjecture harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-a16z-数学家怕-ai-写出千页证明-结果它只写了-15-页/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>數學家怕 AI 寫出千頁證明，結果它只寫了 15 頁</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人類反證一個關於隨機圖的猜想，用了 250 頁、還建立在另外 200 頁之上；AI 在群論內部十幾頁就證出了更弱的那個結論。AI 的數學證明普遍短而優雅，長證明反倒只有人類寫得出來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">數學推理</span><span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"147 ✪ SHEIN回港上市、新拼姆開啟自營 Just-in-time Membersmark\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-fengtouquan-shein-回港上市-最强供应链壁垒反而成了软肋/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f4193533f4aa66ed-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"瘋\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">瘋投圈</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>SHEIN 回港上市，最強供應鏈壁壘反而成了軟肋</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">SHEIN 花很多年搭的供應鏈數據系統，是為了把下單到送達壓到最快；但歐盟對小包開徵關稅之後，快在商業上不再成立，它一半以上的歐洲訂單已經改從本地倉發貨。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">跨境電商</span><span class=\"tag\">SHEIN</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Picky eating, protein, food dyes, and nutrition myths: What parents actually need to know with Jennifer Anderson ARFID rest and digest hyper palatable food health impact tiers\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-secureattach-孩子挑食别怪食物-先修关系-再谈营养/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">58:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>孩子挑食別怪食物：先修關係，再談營養</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">餵養策略本身沒那麼重要，重要的是你怎麼執行；父母先照顧好自己的食物關係，才是對孩子最有效的干預。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">兒童營養</span><span class=\"tag\">挑食</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Walter Russell Mead - How America Keeps Winning - [Invest Like the Best, EP.490] Tech Hamiltonian info-structure Jacksonian soft blockade\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-ilt-让对手依赖你的体系-是美国赢了三百年的秘密/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aa91f50130802ffe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>讓對手依賴你的體系，是美國贏了三百年的秘密</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">荷蘭、英國、美國輪番當老大，靠的不是封鎖而是讓對手把身家性命押進自己的海洋體系——等它們離不開航路與市場，切斷就成了戰爭之外最有效的殺手鐧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美博弈</span><span class=\"tag\">海洋霸權</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Is it time for a Luddite Renaissance? Luddite General Ned Ludd Enoch Frame Breaking Act\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-throughline-卢德分子不是反技术-是反失去议价权的自己/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c7f7bb336e16c273-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">16:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>盧德分子不是反技術，是反失去議價權的自己</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1812 年的盧德分子砸機器，是因為沒有選票、沒有工會，暴力是僅剩的談判手段；今天自稱新盧德分子的人有選票和言論自由，問題變成了要不要讓技術重塑人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 與就業</span><span class=\"tag\">勞工史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Ep 221 Electroconvulsive Therapy Part 2: A current conversation Catatonia Anti-NMDA receptor encephalitis Succinylcholine Retrograde amnesia Transcranial magnetic stimulation (TMS)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-tpwky-ect-不是你想的那样-从密室到常规治疗的百年漂移/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>ECT 不是你想的那樣：從密室到常規治療的百年漂移</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">現代 ECT 是在麻醉和肌肉鬆弛劑下進行的程序，療效顯著，但有關記憶喪失的副作用證據仍不完全清楚，社會對此的誤解導致它被過度汙名化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">精神科</span><span class=\"tag\">電休克療法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"288: How Do I Help My Disorganized Teen? executive functioning time blindness metacognition natural consequences\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-asklisa-孩子丢三落四不是懒-是前额叶还没长好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/747ab52ea57af87e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">37:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>孩子丟三落四不是懶，是前額葉還沒長好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">14歲男孩的前額葉要到25歲才發育完，所以丟三落四不是態度問題。真正的問題是：家長自己的執行功能也不夠用，卻要替孩子搭一套他根本撐不住的系統。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青少年心理</span><span class=\"tag\">執行功能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"End of the Day Crazies With Kids party hat / professional hat yes time\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-unruffled-孩子放学回家就发疯-不是他变坏了-是他终于安全了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">27:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>孩子放學回家就發瘋，不是他變壞了，是他終於安全了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">孩子把一天的壓力全部倒給最親的人，是正常且健康的；父母這時要戴的不是陪玩的「派對帽」，而是立規矩的「職業帽」，那才是真正的優質時間。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育兒</span><span class=\"tag\">情緒調節</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"我們如何老去？從《前浪》窺見中國老年生活的真實圖景 意定監護 軀體化 失獨家庭 空巢老人\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-cn300980-纪录片导演说-没有典型的老年-只有一个个具体的人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda8c0f9bba83da6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"不\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">不合時宜</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>紀錄片導演說：沒有典型的老年，只有一個個具體的人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">拍了兩季《前浪》的范世廣說，大多數婚姻走到最後是不鹹不淡甚至不好的，白頭偕老是鳳毛麟角；我們最缺的不是故事，是錢，和把老人當具體的人看。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">老齡化</span><span class=\"tag\">照護</span>\n</div></div></a>"]